      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. It verifies that `equals()` compares `_timezoneStr` (not the lazily-populated transient `_timezone` field), so two `Value` objects with the same timezone string remain equal regardless of whether `getTimeZone()` was called. Let me write an improved version.The improved test compiled successfully."
